#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""osheet - log timesheet entries to an Excel file based on a TimesheetUpload.xlsx template.

Usage:
    osheet                log an entry (runs setup instead if there is no config yet)
    osheet -m, --multi    log several entries in a row, asking after each whether to add another
    osheet -s, --setup    (re)run the configuration step
    osheet -e, --export   copy the timesheet folder path to the clipboard
    osheet -l, --list     hours per day, week and month, then view, change or delete an entry
                          from the last five weeks
    osheet -H, --hours    show logged hours per category for today, this week or this month
                          (--hours-day, --hours-week, --hours-month skip the question)
    osheet -h, --help     show this help
"""

